Icons in assets/icons/src/ (and the generated dist/icons/sprite.svg) taken from
Feather (https://github.com/feathericons/feather) and Lucide (https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide).
Shapes identical to feather-icons 4.29.2 or lucide-static 0.460.0:

- Feather (MIT): branch (git-branch), code, command, italic, machine (server),
  more-horizontal, project (folder)
- Lucide (ISC): bold, dashboard (layout-dashboard), heading, list, list-ordered,
  panel-left, team (users)

Several other icons, including google.svg, have unconfirmed provenance.
These notices do not clear unmatched shapes or grant rights to Google brand marks.
